<title>USA: Harlan CSD, Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Harlan CSD, Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust said it won $2.090 million of Harlan Community Sch Dist, Iowa, school bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.36 percent.</p>
</text>
